<p>NerdTools installs native command-line tools for Unraid 7.3.4+. Only packages owned by NerdTools can be updated or removed. Changes take effect when you select Apply.</p>
<label for="update_check_hours">Automatic catalog checks</label>
<select name="update_check_hours" id="update_check_hours">
<option value="0">Disabled</option><option value="1">Hourly</option><option value="6">Every 6 hours</option><option value="12">Every 12 hours</option><option value="24" selected>Daily (default)</option><option value="168">Weekly</option>
</select>
<p>Checks only refresh the available versions; they never install updates. Failed checks retry hourly and respect GitHub rate limits. Cached packages and your preferences are retained.</p>
<label for="package_release">Package release</label>
<select id="package_release"><option value="latest">Latest compatible release</option></select>
<input id="btnRelease" type="button" value="Use Release">
<p>Choose a retained release to roll back, then select Apply. Selecting a specific release pins it until you choose Latest compatible release again. Incompatible releases are refused without changing your current cache.</p>
<p id="catalog_status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
<p id="package_error" role="alert" hidden></p>
<div class="wrapper">
<table class="tablesorter hover-highlight" id="tblPackages">
<thead><tr>
<th class="parser-false filter-false">Install</th>
<th class="filter-name" data-placeholder="Search...">Name</th>
<th class="filter-false">Dependencies</th>
<th class="filter-version">Status</th>
<th class="filter-installed">Installed</th>
<th class="sorter-metric filter-false" data-metric-name-full="byte|Byte|BYTE" data-metric-name-abbr="b|B">Size</th>
<th class="filter-false">Installed package</th>
</tr></thead><tbody></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<section id="external_offers" hidden><h3>Original upstream downloads</h3><div></div></section>
<section id="provided_packages" hidden><h3>Built into Unraid</h3><p>These capabilities are supplied by Unraid and cannot be installed, replaced or removed through NerdTools.</p><ul></ul></section>
<input id="btnRefresh" value="Force Updates" type="button" title="Check GitHub Releases now; existing cache is retained on failure">
<input class="reset" type="button" title="Reset applied filters" value="Reset Filters">
<input id="btnSave" type="button" value="Save Settings">
<input id="btnApply" type="button" value="Apply" disabled>
<input type="button" value="Done" onclick="done()">
</form>
